{"id":"beskonechno","lemma":"бесконечно","pos":"adv","rank":3548,"glosses":["endlessly, infinitely, boundlessly","eternally, indefinitely"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9d/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Список можно продолжать бесконечно.","en":"The list is endless.","words":[{"g":"list, register, roll"},{"g":"one can, one may"},{"g":"to continue"},null]},{"text":"Я вам бесконечно благодарен.","en":"I can't thank you enough.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},null,null]},{"text":"Я мог бы бесконечно говорить на эту тему.","en":"I could talk endlessly about this topic.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"would"},null,{"g":"to speak, to talk"},{"g":"on / at"},null,null]},{"text":"Возможностей бесконечно много.","en":"The possibilities are endless.","words":[null,null,{"g":"much"}]},{"text":"Синее небо, казалось, простирается бесконечно.","en":"The blue sky seemed to stretch forever.","words":[{"g":"deep blue","l":"синий"},{"g":"sky"},{"g":"to seem","l":"казаться"},null,null]}]}